                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A笑眯眯}不过，这次流星雨、\n是代表了新生、与希望的星球闪光。\n<style=SizeSmall>是令人安心的奇观，太好了……</style> ",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_827601_3543049638_content",
